    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classicvania hentai that tells the story of Simony BelTits, a vampire hunter who intends to put an end to the reign of horror and orgies of the powerful Vampire VANIA!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064230/extras/2599bb330942dcfb4deb108a84cd26a4.avif?t=1744734924\" width=608 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the castle, from its entrance to the throne room at the top of the castle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have your family's legendary weapon, The Lustful Killer, a legendary whip ready to destroy and sodomize your enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With other weapons obtained from his various enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing axe, dagger, cross, holy water and orgy bible </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 11 H-pixel animations, between humans and monsters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064230/extras/e369a20319615b3dd6c65c24d4dde6c6.poster.avif?t=1744734924\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064230/extras/e369a20319615b3dd6c65c24d4dde6c6.webm?t=1744734924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
